Core-hours a month
  the job, 30 nights             0.001
  the forecast, once             0.006
  the feed check, daily          0.018
  retrains: 3 challengers        0.011
  the API, always on           730.000
  the MCP server                 0.000
  all of it                    730.036
  without the API                0.036
The MCP server runs inside the host that starts it: its time
is the user's, not the service's.
